OL,3,GNEWSABeatles show keeps music
OL,4,Apromoter's legacy alive
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new touring show about the Beatles'
OL,7,Fearly years will be a lasting legacy of
OL,8,Fits writer, the late Stoke-on-Trent
OL,9,Fmusic promoter and record shop owner,
OL,10,FMike Lloyd.
OL,12,FThe Rise of the Beatles is described as
OL,13,F"a gig with narration" and tells the
OL,14,Fstory of the Liverpool band's formation
OL,15,Fup until the moment they appeared at
OL,16,Fthe King's Hall in Stoke in January
OL,17,F1963.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
