OL,3,GNEWSABeatles show keeps music
OL,4,Apromoter's legacy alive
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe gigs were Lloyd's final passion
OL,7,Fproject, before his death in December,
OL,8,Fand came about after he was asked to do
OL,9,Fsomething for the city's centenary
OL,10,Fcelebrations in 2025.
OL,12,FIt was intended to be a one-off but is
OL,13,Fnow being revived as a touring
OL,14,Fproduction.
